The OpenTherm Gateway client (src/otgw/) was written in JavaScript for this
project, from the firmware documentation of the OpenTherm Gateway by Schelte
Bron (https://otgw.tclcode.com/firmware.html: line format, commands, error
codes) and from the message layout and data ids of the OpenTherm 2.2
specification. No code was copied from the gateway firmware, OTmonitor, the
NodoShop OTGW-firmware or the Home Assistant library pyotgw.

